
### Variables
@url = http://localhost:3010/
@apiUrl = http://localhost:3010/api/v1/


### Webpage Endpoint

### Recipe List Endpoint
GET {{apiUrl}}

### Menu List
GET {{apiUrl}}menu

### Menu by ID
GET {{apiUrl}}menu/1

### Events by ID
GET {{apiUrl}}events/2

### Events List
GET {{apiUrl}}events

### Add Menu item Endpoint
